## Definitions

**"commercial use"** means use of the software for the benefit of a
company, organization, or individual with a commercial purpose, or in the
course of business.

A company or organization has a commercial purpose if it seeks or obtains
commercial gain or advantage. An individual has a commercial purpose if
the individual seeks or obtains commercial gain or advantage from use of
the software.

**"noncommercial purpose"** means a purpose other than a commercial
purpose.

**"you"** means a person or legal entity exercising rights under this
license.

**"the software"** means the software made available under these terms, or
the software being distributed under these terms, as the case may be.

